test","side":"staff"},"to":[{"name":"Owen","address":"owen@cedarmedia.test","side":"customer"}],"cc":[],"subject":"Welcome to Wrenfield, Cedar Media!","body":"Hi Owen,\n\nYour workspace for Cedar Media is ready to go. The single highest-leverage thing in week one is creating a real project rather than a test one -- it's what makes the first week actually useful.\n\nI'm here if anything's unclear.\n\nCheers,\nPriya Chen","threadId":"b9472185-bd06-4820-bc1d-a474a5a8e810"},{"id":"f03c254c-6abb-4008-b8c1-9f2618d23178","at":"2026-07-06T11:57:00.669Z","channel":"slack","slackChannel":"#new-signups","author":{"name":"Signup bot","address":null,"side":"bot"},"text":":sparkles: New account: *Cedar Media* (team) is in.","inThread":false},{"id":"e121fd1d-7495-4282-9047-43943e47c283","at":"2026-07-06T11:52:00.728Z","channel":"account","name":"Cedar Media"},{"id":"ac699dbb-7795-4be1-bc82-60c63a3da17f","at":"2026-07-06T11:52:00.728Z","channel":"product","event":"signup","actor":{"name":"Owen","address":"owen@cedarmedia.test","side":"customer"}},{"id":"9aecebb8-3b37-4176-ab3c-d7df828d3dae","at":"2026-07-06T11:52:00.728Z","channel":"billing","plan":"team","status":"active","canceledAt":null},{"id":"50c60f6d-8a3d-432b-a202-96bfd596e0fe","at":"2026-07-06T11:52:00.728Z","channel":"product","event":"first_project","actor":{"name":"Owen","address":"owen@cedarmedia.test","side":"customer"}}],"decisions":[{"id":"325e23e9-83a0-43ae-a2dd-ad377d4e3397","kind":"scheduled","evaluatedAt":"2026-07-13T00:00:00.000Z","rawP":0.25,"calibratedP":0.29341090147988697,"calibratedSource":"stored","rationale":"Project created day 0 [email:aa42e5d1] and onboarding call held [calendar:867cbf88] show real intent, but 6 days in there are no invites, no key milestone, no replies to either outreach [email:ecef5c8a] and no tickets — engagement is one-directional, so unaided activation in the remaining 8 days is possible but not likely.","draft":{"from":"priya@wrenfield.test","to":"owen@cedarmedia.test","subject":"One next step after our call","body":"Hi Owen,\n\nThanks for making time for the getting started call last week — good to see the Cedar Media project already up and running. Projects are the main organizing unit in Wrenfield, and tasks live inside them, so the next bit of momentum usually comes from getting your team in alongside you. A teammate can be invited from Account Settings -> Members at any time, and teammates can be bulk-invited from a CSV file instead of one at a time.\n\nHappy to jump on a quick 15-minute call this week and walk through that first round of invites with you — just say when works.\n\nBest,\nPriya"},"actionId":"5a0dad54-4d3d-4076-bed9-4b9818c8892a","evidenceRefs":["e121fd1d-7495-4282-9047-43943e47c283","9aecebb8-3b37-4176-ab3c-d7df828d3dae","50c60f6d-8a3d-432b-a202-96bfd596e0fe","d93ff0bc-14b4-4b55-be27-e4c5d4d342d4","e20dbeec-cc8f-47da-9d59-4fd774a8edc8","efee19fa-2a52-439d-9c24-c2a6d5d0cf93"],"refs":{"email:aa42e5d1":"d93ff0bc-14b4-4b55-be27-e4c5d4d342d4","email:ecef5c8a":"e20dbeec-cc8f-47da-9d59-4fd774a8edc8","calendar:867cbf88":"efee19fa-2a52-439d-9c24-c2a6d5d0cf93"},"flags":[],"modelId":"claude-opus-5","promptVersion":"draft-v2@19f89f34/effort-medium","costUsd":0.011519999999999999,"trigger":[]}],"outcome":{"outcome":1,"resolvedAt":"2026-07-14T11:52:00.728Z","day":8}}
